1
00:06:15,789 --> 00:06:21,789
Girls Will Be Girls is a drama, romance film directed by Shuchi Talati.

2
00:12:31,578 --> 00:12:37,578
In a strict boarding school nestled in the Himalayas,
16-year-old Mira discovers desire and romance.

3
00:18:47,368 --> 00:18:53,368
But her sexual, rebellious awakening is disrupted by her
mother who never got to come of age herself.

4
00:25:03,157 --> 00:25:09,157
Mira, played by Preeti Panigrahi.

5
00:31:18,947 --> 00:31:24,947
Anila, played by Kani Kusruti.

6
00:37:34,736 --> 00:37:40,736
Sri, played by Kesav Binoy Kiron.

7
00:43:50,526 --> 00:43:56,526
Priya, played by Kajol Chugh.

8
00:50:06,315 --> 00:50:12,315
Divya, played by Nandini Verma.

9
00:56:22,105 --> 00:56:28,105
Mrs. Bansal, played by Devika Shahani.

10
01:02:37,894 --> 01:02:43,894
Girls Will Be Girls is a 2024 coming-of-age drama film,
written and directed by Shuchi Talati.

11
01:08:53,684 --> 01:08:59,684
It stars Preeti Panigrahi, Kani Kusruti, and Kesav Binoy Kiron.

12
01:15:09,473 --> 01:15:15,473
An Indian and French co-production, the film is Talati's feature directorial
debut, as well as the acting debut of both Panigrahi and Kiron.

13
01:21:25,263 --> 01:21:31,263
The film is set in a boarding school in the Himalayan foothills, and centers around teenager Mira's romance with a charming
new student, her subsequent sexual awakening, and at times strained relationship with her protective mother.

14
01:27:41,052 --> 01:27:47,052
The film premiered at the 2024 Sundance Film Festival, where
it participated in the competition section.

15
01:33:56,842 --> 01:34:02,842
It was released on 18 December 2024, on Amazon Prime Video.

16
01:40:12,631 --> 01:40:18,631
Among the film's accolades, it won the Independent Spirit John Cassavetes Award.

17
01:46:28,421 --> 01:46:34,421
The film explores themes of coming of age, woman director, female writer.

18
01:52:44,210 --> 01:52:50,210
The tone is emotional.
